Compile and execute the project's tests

Usage: pooka test [--verbose|--compact]

Compile and run project tests. Skipped tests are checked but not run.

Options:
  --verbose  Show timings, captured output and failure stack traces
  --compact  Show failures and totals only
  -h, --help  Print this help


